# Observe

<Aside title="Reserved — coming when DriftCard ships" data-variant="not">

Observe recipes will be added as the DriftCard and audit runtime contracts ship.
The `DriftCard` and `AuditCard` specs are authored; the runtime implementation is
not yet available.

</Aside>

Observe capability covers:

- Reading drift signals for a registered model or prompt
- Querying the audit trail for a card or run
- Streaming observability events from Skald agents

These how-to pages will be added alongside the DriftCard runtime. Track progress
in [Roadmap](/roadmap/).
